Subject: spi: preserve Pico controller resources and transmit buffers

Allocate controller state before registering its interrupt, unwind GPIO/IRQ
failures, and serialize the singleton camera endpoint with removal and close.
Keep camera writes separate from the character device buffer and reject failed
user copies before GPIO or power changes. Wake blocked readers on removal.

